{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "95fefc6a-29ad-465a-b30f-f3ca38fda2d2",
    "name": "Identity Service API (Nexatech)",
    "description": "Gọi trực tiếp **identity-service** (Auth, Users, Roles, Groups, Membership).\n\n**Cấu hình:** sửa biến `identityBaseUrl` (ví dụ `http://localhost:8080` hoặc qua API Gateway + context-path).\n\n**Luồng gợi ý:** Login → (tuỳ chọn) Refresh / UserInfo / Introspect → tạo Role → Get by name (auto `roleId`) → tạo User (auto `userId`) → gán role / group.\n\nResponse wrapper: `{ code, message, result }`. Token trong `result` dùng **snake_case** (`access_token`, `refresh_token`) theo `UserTokenExchangeResponse`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "40740215"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "I. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. OpenID configuration",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Has result', () => pm.expect(j).to.have.property('result'));",
                  "if (j.result && j.result.issuer) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('openidIssuer', j.result.issuer);",
                  "    console.log('issuer saved to openidIssuer');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{identityBaseUrl}}/auth/openid-configuration",
              "host": [
                "{{identityBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "openid-configuration"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Register user",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const r = j && j.result;",
                  "if (!r) { console.warn('No result'); return; }",
                  "const at = r.access_token || r.accessToken;",
                  "const rt = r.refresh_token || r.refreshToken;",
                  "if (at) { pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', at); console.log('accessToken saved'); }",
                  "if (rt) { pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', rt); console.log('refreshToken saved'); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"nvminh1625\",\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"email\": \"nvminh1625@gmail.com\",\n    \"emailVerified\": true,\n    \"firstName\": \"Minh\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Nguyen\",\n    \"credentials\": [\n        {\n            \"type\": \"password\",\n            \"value\": \"123456789\",\n            \"temporary\": false\n        }\n    ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{identityBaseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{identityBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
